# Rendered manuscript figure outputs. These are regenerated from tracked source
# (manuscript/archive/BehavioralDynamics_schema_preproduction_audit/R/; the
# Figure 1 candidate builder was retired on 2026-10-05, its local rendered/ copy
# stays ignored), so the builders are versioned but their staged SVG/PDF/PNG
# products are not. The schema rendered/ directory alone is ~4.9 MB of PNG.
#
# This replaces a blanket `/manuscript` rule, which also ignored the tracked
# source files under manuscript/Fig1_behavior_candidates/ -- blocking `git add`
# on them -- and hid the manuscript verification scripts under
# manuscript/archive/BehavioralDynamics_schema_preproduction_audit/R/ from
# version control entirely.
manuscript/Fig1_behavior_candidates/rendered/
manuscript/archive/BehavioralDynamics_schema_preproduction_audit/rendered/

# Local publication release bundles built by the release builder (retired on
# 2026-10-05) were written to the local RFID output root, never into the
# repository. This rule only guards against an accidental in-repo build target.
releases/
Rplots.pdf
